[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD007
TITLE: Partition fail-smart case
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall bring a neighbor link down, mark the neighbor picture stale, grant a local landing that the local guard allows, and refuse a handoff. It shall also show that the stale picture is not used to permit a second aircraft into a locally occupied volume. Acceptance is the granted local landing, the refused handoff, and the refused double occupancy.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Fail smart is continued local service plus refusal of dependent clearances.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. Visual separation, LAHSO, radar vectoring, TRACON, enroute control, and wake RECAT are outside this increment.
